GitHub Actions Limitations

Today I learned about the limitations and constraints of GitHub Actions that affect cost, scale, and performance.

🔹 Usage Limits
GitHub Actions has limits on:
Workflow run time
Monthly minutes
Storage usage
Understanding limits avoids interruptions.

🔹 Runner Limits
Runner limitations include:
Concurrent job limits
OS availability
Resource constraints
These impact pipeline throughput.

🔹 Cost Considerations
Costs depend on:
Runner type
Execution time
Storage consumption
Optimized workflows reduce expenses.

🔥 3-Line Takeaway
Limits affect scale.
 Runners affect speed.
 Costs need planning.
